      },
      {
        "y": 188.3,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "50.2"
      },
      {
        "y": 190.9,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 330,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Fill the gaps with words from the opposite page."
      },
      {
        "y": 218.4,
        "x0": 193.2,
        "x1": 511.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The way journalists work has changed a lot over the last twenty years. When"
      },
      {
        "y": 229.2,
        "x0": 198.2,
        "x1": 514.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "I started out as a junior reporter, we had to produce all our 1 to very"
      },
      {
        "y": 241.2,
        "x0": 203.2,
        "x1": 513.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "tight 2 , because we had to make sure it was all in place before the"
      },
      {
        "y": 253.2,
        "x0": 209.2,
        "x1": 512.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "paper 3 to press, ready to be in the shops the next morning. Now"
      },
      {
        "y": 266.4,
        "x0": 214.2,
        "x1": 515.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "a lot of what we do is online, which means we can publish a story only a"
      },
      {
        "y": 277.2,
        "x0": 219.2,
        "x1": 526.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "few minutes after it 4 . It’s much easier to find old articles to check"
      },
      {
        "y": 289.2,
        "x0": 225.2,
        "x1": 520.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "facts, too, because most newspapers have an online 5 that you"
      },
      {
        "y": 302.4,
        "x0": 230.2,
        "x1": 526.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "can access. People expect a lot more photos these days, though, which"
      },
      {
        "y": 313.2,
        "x0": 235.2,
        "x1": 403.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "is why we rely on the 6 so much."
      },
      {
        "y": 341.4,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "50.3"
      },
      {
        "y": 344,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 432.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Answer these questions about the words and expressions in B opposite."
      },
      {
        "y": 360.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 476.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 Would you write to a chief editor asking for a job on his or her ‘rag’? Why / Why not?"
      },
      {
        "y": 372.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 450.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 What do you think about newspapers if you refer to them as the gutter press?"
      },
      {
        "y": 384.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 344.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 What is it very important for journalists not to miss?"
      },
      {
        "y": 396.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 479.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 What two words might describe the kind of story that a journalist dreams of getting?"
      },
      {
        "y": 408.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 427.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 What two expressions refer to the moment of publication of a big story?"
      },
      {
        "y": 420.4,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 406,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "6 Which two crimes are mentioned in B and what do they consist of?"
      },
      {
        "y": 436.8,
        "x0": 78.5,
        "x1": 102,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "50.4"
      },
      {
        "y": 439.3,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 499.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Rewrite these sentences so that they mean the same thing, using the word in brackets."
      },
      {
        "y": 455.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 433.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 Every news report inevitably gives its own particular view of events. ( )"
      },
      {
        "y": 458.2,
        "x0": 415.4,
        "x1": 430.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "spin"
      },
      {
        "y": 467.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 443.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 I have to find some articles from some previous editions of The Times. ( )"
      },
      {
        "y": 470.2,
        "x0": 423.8,
        "x1": 440.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Back"
      },
      {
        "y": 479.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 446.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 The TV news yesterday broadcast something about my favourite singer. ( )"
      },
      {
        "y": 482.2,
        "x0": 430.8,
        "x1": 443.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "ran"
      },
      {
        "y": 491.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 481.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 The floods took up more space in the papers than any other story this week. ( )"
      },
      {
        "y": 494.2,
        "x0": 450.8,
        "x1": 478.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "column"
      },
      {
        "y": 503.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 455.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 Politicians are always ready and willing to give their opinions to the press. ( )"
      },
      {
        "y": 506.2,
        "x0": 441.7,
        "x1": 452,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "air"
      },
      {
        "y": 515.8,
